## SQ-PG-02 | Portal Gun dye recipe: columns, mixing, kept NBT, no output for the bad grids
@group A
@commands #16 recipe: give `qa` a gun and dyes; craft in a crafting table (or `/ztp`-style grid fill) with: blue dye left of the gun; red dye right; lime dye under it; red and yellow both left; on a gun with a custom blue colour, white dye left; a gun renamed and damaged by `/data`; two guns + a dye; gun + dye + stick; gun alone
@pass `CustomPortalColors.blue` set; `.orange` set; both set; the average (orange-ish), not either dye; a mix with the old color, not pure white; name and other NBT kept; no output for the last three
@fails `PortalGunDyeRecipe` (column rule or `mix`); missing output on every case: the recipe JSON did not load (`portal_gun_dye` in the log)
@from batches/r1113/c3_a1.qb
> zc3 craft G minecraft:blue_dye|portalgun:portal_gun|-|-|-|-|-|-|-
waitlog \[c3\] craft 20
expect craft: recipe .* -> 1 portalgun:portal_gun nbt .*CustomPortalColors:\{blue:
> zc3 craft G -|portalgun:portal_gun|minecraft:red_dye|-|-|-|-|-|-
expect craft: recipe .* -> 1 portalgun:portal_gun nbt .*CustomPortalColors:\{orange:
> zc3 craft G -|portalgun:portal_gun|-|-|minecraft:lime_dye|-|-|-|-
expect craft: recipe .* nbt .*CustomPortalColors:\{.*blue:.*orange:|CustomPortalColors:\{.*orange:.*blue:
> zc3 craft G minecraft:red_dye|portalgun:portal_gun|-|minecraft:yellow_dye|-|-|-|-|-
> zc3 craft G minecraft:white_dye|portalgun:portal_gun{CustomPortalColors:{blue:255}}|-|-|-|-|-|-|-
> zc3 craft G minecraft:blue_dye|portalgun:portal_gun{Damage:5,display:{Name:'{"text":"GunC3"}'}}|-|-|-|-|-|-|-
expect nbt .*GunC3
> zc3 craft G portalgun:portal_gun|portalgun:portal_gun|minecraft:blue_dye|-|-|-|-|-|-
> zc3 craft G portalgun:portal_gun|minecraft:blue_dye|minecraft:stick|-|-|-|-|-|-
> zc3 craft G portalgun:portal_gun|-|-|-|-|-|-|-|-
count craft: no recipe >= 3
reject \[c3\] error
look red+yellow left: blue = an orange-ish average, not either dye; white on a gun with blue 255: a mix with the old colour, not pure white; the renamed damaged gun keeps Name and Damage; the last three grids print `no recipe` (row cells: three trailing grids). Lime under the gun sets both

